  <p id="c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">《宋書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001:m0006" ref="31b_fd1_f77">王玄謨</persName>從弟<persName id="c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001:m0011" ref="94x_2iu_gsm">玄象</persName>，位下邳太守。好發冢，地無完椁。時人間垣內有小冢，墳上殆平。每朝日初升，見一女子立冢上，近視則亡。<rs id="c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001:u0062" type="unresolved">或</rs>以告<persName id="c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001:m0065" ref="94x_2iu_gsm">玄象</persName>，便命發之。有一棺尚全，有金蠶銅人以百數。剖棺，見一女子，可二十，姿質若生，臥而言曰：「我東海王家女，應生。資財相奉，幸勿見害。」女臂有玉釧，斬臂取之，于是女復死。</p>
</text>
